ve to do things for free at the  beginning or a super low cost so you're  building up your portfolio you're  building up your experience and you're  building up case study so you can say  hey I helped this person go from here to  here so at the beginning you're looking  for small clients people who could  become testimonials or case studies I  need  if you're not making money off of them  you're building up your portfolio so  that when other clients come to you you  can show them hey you've got all this  work done behind you and you know you're  credible expert the last thing I would  try to do here in terms of just getting  started is try to build up your  expertise by creating content so if you  have a blog write great content on your  website that talks about how small  business owners can help grow their  companies you can create YouTube videos  just like I'm doing here you can share  your thoughts in the video or you can  just answer questions if you see  questions coming in you may not have an  audience yet of people who are asking  you questions but you can go to a forum  of entrepreneurs and see what people are  talking about and just create a video  response and get back to somebody  through your YouTube video depends on  how you know if you like being in front  of the camera or if you prefer the right  but start creating expert content and if  it's publishing on your own blog or if  you're doing guest posting for other  blogs you're starting to build a little  bit of an authority presence again you  have to have enough of a base knowledge  to be able to create this great content  if you don't really know what you're  talking about yet then you have to go  back and get the experience by working  for somebody else and by starting on  this little project with clients but  once you feel you have a bit of a base  knowledge then you can start creating  content and people find it and think wow  this is really great stuff they might  contact you or at least sign up for your  newsletter or take whatever next step  you want them to take so hopefully that  helps it is a bit of a process it's  probably gonna take a lot longer than  you think it's gonna take and be you  know require a lot of energy but  hopefully it's something that you're  really passionate about you believe in  and this is something want to do for the  next 20 years  then it'll be worth the investment and  be super rewarding for you as you  continue to grow so thank you for the  question if those of you watching if you  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below makes you want to do more of  these videos for you and if you have a  comment about this video or you have a  question for your own business  feel free leave it in the comment  section below I always read those and  try to respond to everybody who does  right in so thank you and I'll see you  on the next episode  you
 

